@host = https://localhost:7001
# Seeded accounts: 1 Cash, 2 Loan Receivable, 3 Customer Deposits, 4 Share Capital, 5 Interest Income, 6 Interest Expense

### List accounts
GET {{host}}/api/accounts

### List only liabilities
GET {{host}}/api/accounts?type=Liability

### Create a sub-account under Customer Deposits (parent must be the same type)
POST {{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "2001", "name": "Jane Wanjiru - Savings 00123", "type": "Liability", "parentAccountId": 3 }

### Post a deposit: Dr Cash 5000, Cr Customer Deposits 5000  (expect 201)
POST {{host}}/api/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-16",
  "description": "Cash deposit - Jane Wanjiru",
  "reference": "DEP-00123-20261016",
  "idempotencyKey": "dep-00123-20261016-001",
  "lines": [
    { "accountId": 1, "debit": 5000, "credit": 0 },
    { "accountId": 3, "debit": 0, "credit": 5000 }
  ]
}

### Send the same request again (expect 200, same entry id, nothing new posted)

### Unbalanced entry (expect 400, code "UnbalancedEntry")
POST {{host}}/api/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-16",
  "description": "Broken entry",
  "reference": "BAD-1",
  "lines": [
    { "accountId": 1, "debit": 5000, "credit": 0 },
    { "accountId": 3, "debit": 0, "credit": 4999 }
  ]
}

### Unknown account (expect 404)
POST {{host}}/api/journal-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-16",
  "description": "Ghost account",
  "reference": "BAD-2",
  "lines": [
    { "accountId": 1, "debit": 100, "credit": 0 },
    { "accountId": 999, "debit": 0, "credit": 100 }
  ]
}

### Get an entry (use the id from the first post)
GET {{host}}/api/journal-entries/1

### Reverse it (expect 201; doing it twice gives 409)
POST {{host}}/api/journal-entries/1/reverse
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-16" }

### Cash ledger with running balance
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/1/ledger

### Trial balance
GET {{host}}/api/reports/trial-balance

### Trial balance as of a date
GET {{host}}/api/reports/trial-balance?asOf=2026-10-15